{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ApplicationWindowProtocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ActionGroupProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:3GIO19ActionGroupProtocolP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ActionMapProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:3GIO17ActionMapProtocolP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/WindowProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:3Gtk14WindowProtocolP","text":"WindowProtocol"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Notably, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GtkApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" can handle an application menubar."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This class implements the [iface[ActionGroup](\/\/documentation\/gio\/actiongroup] and [iface[ActionMap](\/\/documentation\/gio\/actionmap]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interfaces, to let you add window-specific actions that will be exported"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the associated [class"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/Application"},{"type":"text","text":"], together with its application-wide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"actions. Window-specific actions are prefixed with the “win.”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prefix and application-wide actions are prefixed with the “app.”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prefix. Actions must be addressed with the prefixed name when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"referring to them from a menu model."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that widgets that are placed inside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GtkApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can also activate these actions, if they implement the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[iface"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/Actionable"},{"type":"text","text":"] interface."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The settings [property"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/Settings"},{"type":"text","text":"] and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[property"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/Settings"},{"type":"text","text":"] tell GTK whether the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"desktop environment is showing the application menu and menubar"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"models outside the application as part of the desktop shell."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For instance, on OS X, both menus will be displayed remotely;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on Windows neither will be."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the desktop environment does not display the menubar, it can be shown in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GtkApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" by setting the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[property"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/ApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":"] property to true. If the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"desktop environment does not display the application menu, then it will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically be included in the menubar or in the window’s client-side"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decorations."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See [class"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/PopoverMenu"},{"type":"text","text":"] for information about the XML language"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GtkBuilder"},{"type":"text","text":" for menu models."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See also: [method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gtk.Application.set_menubar"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}]},{"anchor":"A-GtkApplicationWindow-with-a-menubar","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"A GtkApplicationWindow with a menubar"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The code sample below shows how to set up a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GtkApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a menu bar defined on the [class"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/Application"},{"type":"text","text":"]:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"c","code":["GtkApplication *app = gtk_application_new (\"org.gtk.test\", 0);","","GtkBuilder *builder = gtk_builder_new_from_string (","    \"<interface>\"","    \"  <menu id='menubar'>\"","    \"    <submenu>\"","    \"      <attribute name='label' translatable='yes'>_Edit<\/attribute>\"","    \"      <item>\"","    \"        <attribute name='label' translatable='yes'>_Copy<\/attribute>\"","    \"        <attribute name='action'>win.copy<\/attribute>\"","    \"      <\/item>\"","    \"      <item>\"","    \"        <attribute name='label' translatable='yes'>_Paste<\/attribute>\"","    \"        <attribute name='action'>win.paste<\/attribute>\"","    \"      <\/item>\"","    \"    <\/submenu>\"","    \"  <\/menu>\"","    \"<\/interface>\",","    -1);","","GMenuModel *menubar = G_MENU_MODEL (gtk_builder_get_object (builder, \"menubar\"));","gtk_application_set_menubar (GTK_APPLICATION (app), menubar);","g_object_unref (builder);","","\/\/ ...","","GtkWidget *window = gtk_application_window_new (app);"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/ApplicationWindowProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol exposes the methods and properties of an underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GtkApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation of these can be found in the protocol extension below."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For a concrete class that implements these methods and properties, see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/ApplicationWindow"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Alternatively, use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/ApplicationWindowRef"},{"type":"text","text":" as a lighweight, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unowned"},{"type":"text","text":" reference if you already have an instance you just want to use."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gtk\/applicationwindowprotocol"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/AccessibleProtocol","doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/BuildableProtocol","doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/ConstraintTargetProtocol","doc:\/\/Gtk\/3GIO19ActionGroupProtocolP","doc:\/\/Gtk\/3GIO17ActionMapProtocolP","doc:\/\/Gtk\/4GLib14PointerWrapperP","doc:\/\/Gtk\/10GLibObject24InitiallyUnownedProtocolP","doc:\/\/Gtk\/10GLibObject0B8ProtocolP","doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/NativeProtocol","doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/RootProtocol","doc:\/